Checking one.go The first thing to
settle is which of these holds: • the
file was read before it was written •
the file was written before it was read
func main() { println("one") } So the
read has to come first.
read target.txt ✓ 1L
A plain thought with no markup in it at
all.
┌───────┬────────┐ │ what │ when │
├───────┼────────┤ │ read │ first │
├───────┼────────┤ │ write │ second │
└───────┴────────┘

The read came first, and the file holds
one.
